um commercial tower located in the heart of JLT, offering state-of-the-art office spaces across 4 basement levels, a ground floor, and 40 upper floors. It’s designed for businesses seeking modern infrastructure and a strategic location in Dubai.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Me Do Re Business Jumeirah Lake Towers?"},{"id":6912,"answer":"<p>The project offers shell &amp; core office units ranging in size from 1,077 to 2,131 sq. ft., each with an attached washroom and pantry.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of office spaces are available?"},{"id":6913,"answer":"<p>Prices for Me Do Re Jumeirah Business Lake Towers start from AED 3.9 million to AED 6.9 million, depending on the size and floor level.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the starting price of office units?"},{"id":6914,"answer":"<p>The project features world-class amenities, including an infinity pool, fully equipped gym, steam and sauna rooms, and a golf simulation room. It also has a luxurious five-floor high lobby space.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are available in the building?"},{"id":6915,"answer":"<p>The completion of Me Do Re Business Tower is expected in Q4 2029.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"When is the expected completion date?"},{"id":6916,"answer":"<p>Buyers can benefit from a 60/40 payment plan, with 60% during construction and 40% on handover. Post-completion payment plans are also available across 1, 2, 3, or 4 years.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the payment plan for purchasing an office?"},{"id":6917,"answer":"<p>Yes, each office comes with 1 dedicated parking space.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is parking available with each office unit?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"i/Me_Do_Re_Business_in_Jumeirah_Lake_Towers_0eeabf1ad5.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Me_Do_Re_Business_in_Jumeirah_Lake_Towers_0eeabf1ad5.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu